Package: quire
Title: A Word-Like Report Builder for Shiny
Version: 0.2.16
Authors@R: c(
      person("David", "Kariuki", , "hello@damurka.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-6159-1107")),
      person("African Population and Health Research Center (APHRC)",
            role = c("cph", "fnd"))
    )
Description: Quire's report builder in a Shiny app: a Word-like editor of documents and slide decks that
    writes Word, PowerPoint and PDF files itself, in the browser. The app is its host: it says what charts and
    tables it can draw and draws them (with 'ggplot2' or any other way), and keeps the reports; everything else,
    the editing, the page layout, the files and an AI's reading and editing of reports, is done by the builder.
